{"page":364,"verses":[{"verse_key":"25:44","surah":25,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ تَحْسَبُ أَنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ يَسْمَعُونَ أَوْ يَعْقِلُونَ ۚ إِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۖ بَلْ هُمْ أَضَلُّ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you think that most of them hear or understand? They are just like cattle- no, they are further from the path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَحْسَبُ","en_gloss":"do you think","transliteration":"taḥsabu","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","en_gloss":"most of them","transliteration":"aktharahum","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"hear","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَعْقِلُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"(are) except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۖ","en_gloss":"like cattle","transliteration":"kal-anʿāmi","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَضَلُّ","en_gloss":"(are) more astray","transliteration":"aḍallu","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَبِيلًا","en_gloss":"(from the) way","transliteration":"sabīlan","verse_key":"25:44"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:44"}]},{"verse_key":"25:45","surah":25,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَيْفَ مَدَّ ٱلظِّلَّ وَلَوْ شَآءَ لَجَعَلَهُۥ سَاكِنًا ثُمَّ جَعَلْنَا ٱلشَّمْسَ عَلَيْهِ دَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you not see how your Lord lengthens the shade? If He had willed, He could have made it stand still- We made the sun its indicator-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do you not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"[to]","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَدَّ","en_gloss":"He extends","transliteration":"madda","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظِّلَّ","en_gloss":"the shadow","transliteration":"l-ẓila","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"He willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَجَعَلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"surely He (could) have made it","transliteration":"lajaʿalahu","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَاكِنًۭا","en_gloss":"stationary","transliteration":"sākinan","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","en_gloss":"the sun","transliteration":"l-shamsa","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":16,"ar":"دَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"an indication","transliteration":"dalīlan","verse_key":"25:45"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:45"}]},{"verse_key":"25:46","surah":25,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ قَبَضْنَـٰهُ إِلَيْنَا قَبْضًا يَسِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but We gradually draw it towards Us, little by little.",