ion":"","verse_key":"25:47"}]},{"verse_key":"25:48","surah":25,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَرْسَلَ ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ بُشْرًۢا بَيْنَ يَدَىْ رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ وَأَنزَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً طَهُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who sends the winds as heralds of good news before His Mercy. We send down pure water from the sky,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْسَلَ","en_gloss":"sends","transliteration":"arsala","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرِّيَـٰحَ","en_gloss":"the winds","transliteration":"l-riyāḥa","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بُشْرًۢا","en_gloss":"(as) glad tidings","transliteration":"bush'ran","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَدَىْ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"yaday","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"His Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We send down","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"طَهُورًۭا","en_gloss":"pure","transliteration":"ṭahūran","verse_key":"25:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٨","en_gloss":"(48)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:48"}]},{"verse_key":"25:49","surah":25,"ayah":49,"ar_uthmani":"لِّنُحْـِۧىَ بِهِۦ بَلْدَةً مَّيْتًا وَنُسْقِيَهُۥ مِمَّا خَلَقْنَآ أَنْعَـٰمًا وَأَنَاسِىَّ كَثِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"so that We can revive a dead land with it, and We give it as a drink to many animals and people We have created.","